# ETF AI Agent (CLI, no UI yet)

This project is a local, privacy-preserving ETF analysis and decision agent.

Features:
- Download historical ETF data (Yahoo Finance via `yfinance`, "https://www.marketwatch.com/investing/fund")
- Clean and preprocess price data
- Compute basic features (returns, volatility, drawdowns)
- Simple forecasting model (linear regression)
- Risk metrics (volatility, max drawdown)
- Naive portfolio optimizer (equal-weight example)
- Backtesting of simple signals (BUY/HOLD/SELL)
- Rule-based decision engine
- CLI entry point via `python -m etf_agent.app`

